<title>GERMANY: KARSTADT SAYS SCHICKEDANZ GROUP TO BUY KARSTADT STAKES. [CORRECTED 17:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>KARSTADT SAYS SCHICKEDANZ GROUP TO BUY KARSTADT STAKES. [CORRECTED 17:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to add &quot;Karstadt says&quot;; corrects first paragraph to make clear that Schickedanz plans to take over two stakes in Karstadt held by Commerzbank and Deutsche Bank, not stakes held in the two banks.)</p>
<p>German retail group Karstadt said on Monday the Schickedanz group would take over two stakes in Karstadt held by Commerzbank AG and Deutsche Bank AG.</p>
<p>The share package would total 20.3 percent of the retailing firm's capital, Karstadt said in a statement</p>
